# Sample requests - can be run directly from VS Code (REST Client extension) or Visual Studio
@api = http://localhost:5080

### Business entities
GET {{api}}/api/metadata/entities

### Fields available for controls on employees (including department and branch)
GET {{api}}/api/metadata/entities/Employee/fields

### Operators
GET {{api}}/api/metadata/operators

### Control list
GET {{api}}/api/controls

### Run control 1
POST {{api}}/api/controls/1/run

### Preview a definition (description in words + SQL)
POST {{api}}/api/controls/preview
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "version": 1,
  "entity": "Employee",
  "condition": {
    "type": "group", "logic": "and",
    "conditions": [
      { "type": "rule", "field": "isActive", "operator": "isTrue" },
      { "type": "rule", "field": "department.branch.isActive", "operator": "isFalse" }
    ]
  }
}

### Test run without saving
POST {{api}}/api/controls/test-run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entity": "Employee",
  "condition": { "type": "rule", "field": "email", "operator": "isEmpty" }
}

### Injection attempt - stays a plain parameter value, nothing happens
POST {{api}}/api/controls/test-run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entity": "Employee",
  "condition": { "type": "rule", "field": "lastName", "operator": "equals", "value": "x'; DROP TABLE dbo.Employees; --" }
}

### Invalid definition - returns 400 with the list of errors
POST {{api}}/api/controls/preview
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entity": "Employee",
  "condition": { "type": "rule", "field": "salary", "operator": "contains", "value": "abc" }
}
